  <Docs>
    <summary>
            Defines the HTTP header names used across the AgentServer platform.
            These headers form the wire contract between the Foundry platform,
            agent containers, and downstream storage services.
            </summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>
        <b>Response headers</b> (set by the server on every response):</para>
      <list type="bullet">
        <item>
          <see cref="F:Azure.AI.AgentServer.Core.PlatformHeaders.RequestId" /> — request correlation ID.</item>
        <item>
          <see cref="F:Azure.AI.AgentServer.Core.PlatformHeaders.ServerVersion" /> — server SDK identity.</item>
        <item>
          <see cref="F:Azure.AI.AgentServer.Core.PlatformHeaders.SessionId" /> — resolved session ID (when applicable).</item>
      </list>
      <para>
        <b>Error response headers</b> (set on 4xx/5xx responses):</para>
      <list type="bullet">
        <item>
          <see cref="F:Azure.AI.AgentServer.Core.PlatformHeaders.ErrorSource" /> — classifies error origin (<c>user</c>, <c>platform</c>, or <c>upstream</c>).</item>
        <item>
          <see cref="F:Azure.AI.AgentServer.Core.PlatformHeaders.ErrorDetail" /> — internal diagnostic detail for platform telemetry.</item>
      </list>
      <para>
        <b>Request headers</b> (set by the platform or client):</para>
      <list type="bullet">
        <item>
          <see cref="F:Azure.AI.AgentServer.Core.PlatformHeaders.RequestId" /> — client-provided correlation ID (echoed back on the response).</item>
        <item>
          <see cref="F:Azure.AI.AgentServer.Core.PlatformHeaders.UserIsolationKey" /> / <see cref="F:Azure.AI.AgentServer.Core.PlatformHeaders.ChatIsolationKey" /> — platform isolation keys.</item>
        <item>
          <see cref="F:Azure.AI.AgentServer.Core.PlatformHeaders.ClientHeaderPrefix" /> — prefix for pass-through client headers.</item>
        <item>
          <see cref="F:Azure.AI.AgentServer.Core.PlatformHeaders.TraceParent" /> — W3C Trace Context propagation header.</item>
        <item>
          <see cref="F:Azure.AI.AgentServer.Core.PlatformHeaders.ClientRequestId" /> — Azure SDK client correlation header.</item>
      </list>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
